From: DrakeRamorayJr <179530612+DrakeRamorayJr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:39:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bare: make the status bar part of the dimmed backdrop behind
 the sheet

The decor shade used to dim the light chrome status-bar colour at 0.35
while the page-card margin was the backdrop at full dim, so the status
bar showed as a grey band above a black strip. The status bar, the 8dp
gap under it and the backdrop behind the page card now share one
colour from backdropColor(dim), the page card starts below the gap,
and the status-bar icons follow that colour. Everything is restored on
close.
